      "text": [
        " عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ:\n۝ وَ مَنْ قُدِرَ عَلَيْهِ رِزْقُهُ فَلْيُنْفِقْ مِمّٰا آتٰاهُ اَللّٰهُ ۝\nقَالَ \"إِنْ أَنْفَقَ عَلَيْهَا مَا يُقِيمُ ظَهْرَهَا مَعَ كِسْوَةٍ وَ إِلاَّ فُرِّقَ بَيْنَهُمَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4530 - Rubi ibn Abdullah and Al-Fudhayl ibn Yasar narrated from Abu Abdillah (as) regarding the saying of Allah (swt), the Mighty and Majestic:\n\"And whoever has his provision restricted, let him spend from what Allah (swt) has given him\" (Surah At-Talaq 65:7).\nImam (as) said: \"If he provides for her what sustains her strength along with clothing, then it is sufficient. Otherwise, they shall be separated.\""
        ]
      }
